# UI design (tray app)

- Match existing light/dark themes via `ThemeService` and `AppTheme.*.xaml`.
- Status panel: scannable health, errors/warnings counts, progress steps, clickable URL when port is ready.
- Settings: clear labels for run mode, launch profile, file-change behaviour.
- Avoid modal overload — tray-first workflow; settings and log viewer as separate windows.
- Keep XAML code-behind thin — orchestration stays in Infrastructure.

After XAML edits, user verifies via `tray-ui-change` skill handoff.
